  <!--EN: Haute cuisine is the pinnacle of culinary artistry, emphasizing meticulous preparation, refined techniques, and exquisite presentation. It transforms the finest ingredients into visually stunning and harmoniously balanced dishes, elevating dining to an experience of sophistication. This research also unlocks the haute section, a specialized workstation for crafting these masterful creations.-->
  <VCE_HauteCuisine.description>高级菜肴是烹饪艺术的顶峰，强调精心准备、精湛技术和精美呈现。它将最好的食材转化为视觉上令人惊叹且和谐平衡的菜肴，将用餐提升为精致的体验。这项研究还解锁了高级部分，这是一个专门用于制作这些精湛作品的工作站。</VCE_HauteCuisine.description>
